          "url": "https://movingimage.org/event/poltergeist/"
        },
        {
          "text": "Handcrafted Horror",
          "url": "https://movingimage.org/series/handcrafted-horrors/"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "IFC Center Ken Russell’s reconstructed The Devils continues on a restored 35mm print—read (or listen to) our interview with Mark Kermode on it—while The Exorcist , Grey Gardens , and Ju-On: The Grudge play late.",
      "links": [
